<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Friday it lowered its rating on the shares of Tom Brown Inc to hold from buy, based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1-1/4 to 22-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
